   "en": "export fuel",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/events/SindrianDiktatHostileActivityFactor.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 30,
   "en": "improved",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/events/SindrianDiktatHostileActivityFactor.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 31,
   "en": "Event progress is based on maximum fuel production. %s below %s per colony should be enough to divert the Diktat's attention.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/events/SindrianDiktatStandardActivityCause$1.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 32,
   "en": "Knocking the Diktat out of the fuel production game is also an option. Much of their fuel production depends on a Domain-era Synchrotron Core installed in their production facilities on Sindria.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/events/SindrianDiktatStandardActivityCause$1.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 33,
   "en": "Reducing production levels ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/events/SindrianDiktatStandardActivityCause$1.class"
  },
  {
