   "en": "Synchrotron Core",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/events/SindrianDiktatStandardActivityCause$1.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 35,
   "en": "Your colony production of fuel is high enough for the Sindrian Diktat - which depends on its own fuel production for much of its economy - to take notice.",
