   "en": "Event progress value is based on the number and size of colonies under your control. Requires one size %s colony, or at least %s colonies with one being at least size %s.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/events/StandardPerseanLeagueActivityCause$1.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 46,
   "en": "Going to Kazeron and negotiating to join the League is likely to get this harassment to stop. If left unchecked, this low-grade conflict will eventually come to a head and is likely to be resolved one way or another.",
